# ==== Userbot (Premium features) ====
# Enable userbot mode for voice chat joins and premium emoji sending.
# Set USERBOT_SESSION to a valid session string, or set USER_PHONE to your phone number.
# Userbot allows the bot to join voice chats where it can't start calls natively,
# and enables custom premium emoji sending.
